  "solution": {
    "text": "We have,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>n</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>n</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> is many one.<br /><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></math> is onto."
